      "message": "wip(3d): #1749 mask edge - erode the unmasked target, drop masked residue strips\n\nWork in progress, handed to agy on len (user, 2026-11-16: \"Give agy the logo stuff\").\nGate and clippy were green on this change; not yet confirmed on the user's\nsc_logo project (regeneration took over 7 minutes and was not finished).\n\nRefs #1749\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
