      "message": "fix(3d): keep masked 3D Pocket clear to open edges and ignore wall collars\n\nErode the unmasked per-level target in `ladder()` so only part islands\nact as walls, then filter cutter centers in `mask_center()` against the\nre-machining mask intersected with the swept tool envelope `center.offset(r)`\nand opened by `MASK_RESIDUE` mitered lattice cells (`offset_sharp`).\nThis keeps open-sided notch corners cleared after an outside profile cut\nwhile preserving redundant-op refusal with or without `stock_to_leave`.\n\nFixes #1749",
